    if(_defIllActiveP) narrative.push(`  🌫 The ever-shifting illusory ground of ${prov.name} throws ${defName}'s forces into confusion — every unit fights as though mired in the worst terrain for its kind (at least −15% strength).`);
    // WHITE L7 — Sanctuary: enemies of the warding caster fight at −25% in the warded province this
